    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="433e3718-345a-5c4b-bc2c-91888b753868" activityNameId="2f289aab-26f8-5695-a8d9-ab807749cab9" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Facilities anode refinery, secondary copper</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Facilities anode refinery, secondary copper
Production of twin anode casting wheel and electrolytic cells: chromium steel, refractory bricks and concrete foundation. Building hall houses the facilities, covering 6883m2. Service lifetime 30 years, yearly capacity of 230'000 t copper refined.;
UUID: ca401231-3411-3e61-9f2a-bacfe5756c45
Construction of facilities and housing, and their disposal. No transports and construction work considered.
Location: Data describes a Swedish plant that is singular in the region and ranges worldwide among the big producer. It may be taken as approximation for the global situation
Technology: Due to high temperature chromium steel and refractory materials are used. Kaldo converter and converter aisle considered.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: estimation 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: see Geography and Technology
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ca401231-3411-3e61-9f2a-bacfe5756c45.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
